## Model card (verified facts only)

- **Name:** Qwen 3.5 Flash Lite
- **Short description:** Alibaba's MoE Qwen 3.5 Flash-Lite API tier (~35B total / ~3B active per the folder's curated metadata), offered for high-volume multimodal work at ultra-low pricing; a distinct hosted tier, not the 35B-A3B open-weights checkpoint.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud Model Studio / Qwen Cloud (commercial tier), OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions. No OpenCode Zen Free ID confirmed.
- **Release / knowledge:** Qwen 3.5 generation (2026); exact date not stated in the sources found. Knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** `qwen3.5-flash-lite` (hosted tier).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 total; 65,536 max output (curated metadata / hosted catalogue).
- **Modalities:** text, image and video in; text out; tool calling.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-23):** ~$0.10/$0.40 per 1M in/out (commercial Alibaba Cloud tier).
- **Architecture:** hosted MoE serving profile, proprietary endpoint.

